{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:00 2026-11-01 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"吳千語雨林瀑布同老公施伯雄攬到實  性感泳衣迎33歲生日  大晒極致S形玲瓏身材\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63cf85c0085a5b37c7f051f6f22405d0/2026-11/KF_-_2026-11-01T185241_487.png\"/>\n<p>吳千語近日迎來33歲生日，她與老公施伯雄（Brian）飛往印尼的莫約島度假兼慶祝，吳千語在社交平台上載了多張旅行靚相，又晒性感泳照大派福利，相中她跟老公亦頻頻甜蜜放閃，二人於森林溪流中親密相擁，施伯雄從後環抱老婆，恩愛之情羨煞旁人。</p>\n<h2>吳千語大晒白滑肌膚修長美腿</h2>\n<p>吳千語在今次的慶生之旅大解放，相中所見，她換上一套黑白花紋連身泳衣，完美展現其修長美腿與玲瓏有致的S形身材，肌膚白滑，她更在熱帶雨林瀑布下暢泳，仙氣爆棚。而最震撼的莫過於她換上黑色緊身泳衣潛水，與巨型鯨鯊近距離並肩同游，吳千語於水中姿態優美，宛如一條美麗的美人魚，不少網民看過後都紛紛留言大讚其身材，更直呼這一幕「美得令人窒息」。</p>\n<img alt=\"吳千語上載身穿婚紗的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5757a05a71972f6b6f8cf656ad85ab04/2024-08/Holding_this_moment_close_1__Karena__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語成為豪門少奶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a027813c8977043b409e9b202ad9554/2024-08/Holding_this_moment_close_5__Karena__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在彩虹煙火映襯下，兩人拗腰深情擁吻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/322827f5430c34f8b31fecf5c5c23cc4/2024-08/Holding_this_moment_close_7__Karena__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語近日的生日旅行穿上性感泳裝，大派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a17b542383b3dc8c3f6774b9105d3430/2026-11/SaveClip_App_873642488_18648714871017961_1245529785025498853_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語於壯麗瀑布下盡騷逆天修長美腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0cebb7df910ca40eee1fd2e67593e51/2026-11/SaveClip_App_875104277_18648714715017961_4196553051433688521_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語戴上眼鏡素顏出行，坐觀光車探索島上原始森林\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c7927478a4f3284551ca50d524caa65/2026-11/SaveClip_App_875724553_18648714727017961_2274438405495681700_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\" 吳千語換上深色吊帶裙優雅現身，準備享受老公悉心安排的原始風浪漫晚餐。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5dd3eb608537c0785c647b34b3e401f1/2026-11/SaveClip_App_877579136_18648715069017961_7999646446139833558_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語化身性感美人魚，與巨型鯨鯊超近距離同游。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd40e40ef8c3c7e494480a6b5e41dfae/2026-11/SaveClip_App_877579141_18648714517017961_4036446219809980928_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語展現優美泳姿，在深海中睇鯨鯊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41dccb16f70cd34f5407938890960047/2026-11/SaveClip_App_877604860_18648714544017961_6109135143383894637_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語與老公施伯雄在森林溪流中甜蜜攬攬，恩愛指數爆燈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28895bbfa52ce46c1b111c3f44e6fff2/2026-11/SaveClip_App_878413766_18648714841017961_8458325375956374921_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語一身清爽打扮，在瀑布前拍照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32f963b880b4ae7b89b9c2ee2544ce11/2026-11/SaveClip_App_879797057_18648714889017961_8965447247399775310_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語在熱帶雨林瀑布下暢泳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d0c12489d98ae80fe4baabb8bf8cf64/2026-11/SaveClip_App_880048988_18648714622017961_5520138435804481351_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語在印尼莫約島慶祝33歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e8038c0cceabfd5f380dc53d79b79cc/2026-11/SaveClip_App_880459029_18648714571017961_676950760054583214_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語對著精緻的水果蛋糕甜笑，一臉幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f0f4d17f91be339c7c547bc999f0df8f/2026-11/SaveClip_App_884873581_18648715051017961_8625883749917971436_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語與丈夫施伯雄穿上藍色系情侶裝，向施伯雄爺爺拜年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/689eb33703442068aedcceb923917490/2026-02/1_2_28.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語蹲在地上細心整理揮春，爺爺施子清在旁看著，場面溫馨，盡顯豪門乖孫媳的模樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a737d734ae6a5020a3d29e2ae19f6827/2026-02/8_5_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"龍紋屏風似乎價值不菲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2aaa2eff72f8f3e47aee57badf11700b/2026-02/5_5_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"以施家新抱身分過年的吳千語，與親友在巨型桃花樹前擺出恭賀姿勢，喜氣洋洋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc8cf071909bb8a15a8c0ea39270e93c/2026-02/3_5_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語與施伯雄穿上藍色系唐裝情侶裝拜年，羡煞旁人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/540cad7211dc9465d456ae5f9188585b/2026-02/2_4_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語公屋出身，施伯雄卻是「富三代」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88b7dc36d654c77ded9d89fe897d988c/2024-12/buzhibujuerenshouleshiboxiong1nianle_3_shiboxiong_brian_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"施伯雄曾爆料指與吳千語拍拖初期，不被父親認可。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d474d0c27778e0d26e1fdfa3f09f3491/2024-12/happy_1st_anniversary_ma_love_4_wuqianyukarena_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語努力下，獲施伯雄的家人接納。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2304eebdb3d865e4ce6ec012b5e78ddd/2024-12/buzhibujuerenshouleshiboxiong1nianle_1_shiboxiong_brian_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民大讚吳千語大方，又懂得為人處事，盡現貼心一面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5142ef366d20ec03e42db57ae3ed846c/2025-02/_3__Karena__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"施伯雄去年新年晒出夫妻合照，見到吳千語手上有一大疊利是。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/348e00a92a4f16fe9fceaf2c3ee8f20e/2025-02/_5__Brian__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"施伯雄曾曝光吳千語跪在地上，向施伯雄爺爺施子清拜年的模樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da8d46d69479a1a2f004e5f5e47a66fa/2025-02/WhatsApp_Image_2025-02-10_at_4_14_58_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"施伯雄曾在社交網公開一段影片，表示：「爺爺看到施伯雄沒表情！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0b82f4ca51d84517c92606fa19f3e17/2025-10/Karena_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"施伯雄走到爺爺施子清面前自拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/710c8909f77b2f68813d0e8965ac3f29/2025-10/Karena_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"施伯雄的爺爺施子清握住一人之手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe156b4da459436a64854666bde2c381/2025-10/Karena_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語在一場合，被施伯雄的爺爺施子清握住手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b907328885410030d5466e310441b40/2025-10/Karena_38_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"施伯雄的爺爺似乎對孫新抱吳千語好滿意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/988b3cd611a7091e79cc8f27c5e234aa/2025-10/Karena_39_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>吳千語於森林餐廳慶祝生日</h2>\n<p>除了充滿動感的戶外行程外，老公施伯雄更為愛妻準備了浪漫的慶生晚宴。在充滿原始風情的森林餐廳內，吳千語身穿深色優雅吊帶裙，對著精緻的水果生日蛋糕甜笑拍照，碟上更用朱古力醬寫有「Happy Birthday Ms. Karena」，細節中盡顯對老婆的無微不至。網民除了送上生日祝福，亦留言大讚施伯雄是「滿分好老公」，指二人結婚後越來越有夫妻相，蜜月式慶生甜蜜滿瀉。</p>\n<img alt=\"吳千語與施伯雄早前接受內地家居雜誌訪問。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/decc4d5711cce16e851b3cb2e202c24c/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_00_02_618.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語首度公開了4層高的愛巢。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee04ea940971790b21746bc3641b8841/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_00_15_819.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語表示客廳設計的初衷是為了招待朋友。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ced9f15c938a1f88ccc0b46cb2c48a0/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_00_17_407.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"整體以溫潤的白色牆面搭配深色家具，營造出溫暖舒適的氛圍。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0320bc9526f6c9fd20c63caad4da8439/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_00_21_467.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語形容這張梳化「像一個擁抱的感覺」。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ddd11b8d8b21328922f9c6f468db6eb/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_01_03_486.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳中最有趣的亮點，莫過於牆上一幅由藝術家 Jack Penny 創作的畫作。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d472a1c7761ca48b7936912e5d42f81/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_01_05_836.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"從客廳通往廚房的門拱，採用了來自法國、極為稀有的「Breche de Benou」大理石。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7a16259c181c60f150d68110ce3099e/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_01_32_924.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語表示，正因這塊石材太過特別，才特意與供應商精心設計，以突顯其顏色與紋理。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d8449142337a2bd0e7bdc9b94fc5336/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_01_35_040.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"獨特而斑斕的紋理讓人驚嘆。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6bcf787a90e87c3c597425b5af428096/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_02_01_099.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千身為家中「煮飯擔當」，對廚房的設計也格外用心。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c3f054ac79dd782de67c519b36d6fec9/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_02_44_866.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"施伯雄雖然在影片中話語不多，卻時而現身陪伴。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9bf805ba8933e4b01f3e90f224b7b2e2/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_03_15_090.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語對廚房的設計也格外用心。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57318ce6683f23da7a080adb7633c595/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_04_07_689.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"西廚部分的中島，選用了來自巴西、名為「Taj Mahal」的石材（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2580296b50a506868e9372501bd1eb7/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_04_24_213.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語家居充滿生活感。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/845531775417b4b381db37a44ac4db8e/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_04_29_273.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語為了家中的兩隻愛犬，他們特意搬到這個有花園的房子。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f14bb27e1b487e5f1a7159e22b868795/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_04_49_461.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語的房間簡潔（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/adae4794663fa38f7ff7f8072d499ac1/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_05_07_760.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"營造出溫暖舒適的氛圍。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d6732f0b79575ddddcaeffdc8bce8f2/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_05_27_643.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"盡顯女主人品味。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c043225266b0f2eb0b203fb0072b273/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_05_36_592.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語的衣帽間。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07e284bef13ce4aad07e8d97afba5ac8/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_06_03_783.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"讓狗狗們有足夠的空間奔跑玩樂。（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e338b2d526acd24eaf2da12d84a8472/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_06_11_800.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳千語說：「感覺回到家裡，一天的疲憊都可以消除。」（安邸AD＠小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b5a29ca77fadd8ca423fc8fd2d58e411/2026-06/ng_mp4_snapshot_06_14_483.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.500444+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":516,"images":52,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T12:00:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:38:46.092171+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:04.737046+00:00","content_hash":"75c556802f2a4af751184c86d2f7a1e7a53e469549a8ce1f8c1930f48b4fe968","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}